  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/04/IMG_2242.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>El Centro Integral de Mayores (CIM) de Onda ha acogido la tarde de este jueves el primer concierto p&uacute;blico del proyecto Junts Fem Rock, en el que colaboran la asociaci&oacute;n Rellamp, que re&uacute;ne a los grupos&nbsp;musicales locales, con personas mayores. Tres mujeres y un hombre, con la ayuda de m&uacute;sicos de Rellamp han interpretado cl&aacute;sicos del rock.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rockterceraedat/img_2106.jpg\" alt=\"img_2106\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rockterceraedat/img_2107.jpg\" alt=\"img_2107\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rockterceraedat/img_2109.jpg\" alt=\"img_2109\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rockterceraedat/img_2110.jpg\" alt=\"img_2110\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rockterceraedat/img_2113.jpg\" alt=\"img_2113\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rockterceraedat/img_2115.jpg\" alt=\"img_2115\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rockterceraedat/img_2118.jpg\" alt=\"img_2118\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rockterceraedat/img_2119.jpg\" alt=\"img_2119\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rockterceraedat/img_2121.jpg\" alt=\"img_2121\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img sr